==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɪnˈkoʊdɪŋ/|a=GA}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɪnˈkəʊdɪŋ/|a=RP}}
* {{rhymes|en|əʊdɪŋ|s=3}}
* {{hyph|en|en|cod|ing}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} The way in which [[symbol]]s are mapped onto [[byte]]s, e.g. in the rendering of a particular [[font]], or in the mapping from keyboard input into visual text.
# A conversion of plain text into a code or [[cypher]] form (for [[decoding]] by the recipient).

